## smart-media-view
- models like users, products, businesses have .media field . example
  "media": {
    "gallery": [File],
    "thumbnail": File
}   
- use url field to display or play the media file
- show Spinner when loading
- show assets/images/no_media.png if no file
- use core/cache/ for caching

## smart-media-delete
- use the api DELETE /api/files/:fileId
example responce
{
    "level": "verbose",
    "status": 200,
    "message": "file deleted",
    "data": null
}

## smart-media-carousel
- display media.thumbnail plus media.gallery

## smart-media-thumbnail-block
- display media.thumbnail with an upload button
- media thumbnail block can be used in:
    - profile screen (edit profile photo)
    - create and edit business screens
    - create and edit product screens
- it supports:
    - upload file
    - copy current file url
    - paste a valid url
    - remove current file
